# Product Visual Identity

## Personality

- precise
- professional
- calm
- structured
- trustworthy
- engineering-minded (OpenText ECM / SAP specialist, not generic SaaS)

## Typography

Primary:
`--font-sans` (Plus Jakarta Sans Variable) with CJK-safe system fallbacks

Display:
`--font-display` (same family as sans)

Secondary:
`--font-mono` (system mono) - codes, registration numbers, technical labels

Do not load full CJK web fonts. Use the existing typography tokens and font-scale toggle.

## Color

Background:
`--bg` / `--color-bg`

Elevated surface:
`--bg-elevated` / `--color-bg-elevated`

Muted surface:
`--bg-muted` / `--color-bg-muted`

Foreground:
`--fg` / `--color-fg`

Muted / subtle text:
`--fg-muted` / `--fg-subtle`

Border:
`--border` / `--border-strong`

Primary:
`--primary` / `--color-primary` (brand cyan family; AA-safe for white text)

Accent:
`--accent` / `--color-accent` (lime `#C0C820` family)

Focus ring:
`--ring`

Navy invert chrome:
`--bg-invert` (deep navy `#000C28` / `#001F5C` family)

Do not introduce colors outside the design system without justification.
Prefer semantic tokens over raw logo hex (`#00B8E0`, `#C0C820`, `#001F5C`) in components.

## Shape

Default radius:
`--radius-md` (0.75rem)

Use larger radius only for:
- cards / panels / media frames (`--radius-lg` / `--radius-xl`)
- smaller controls / chips (`--radius-sm`)

## Density

Target density:
comfortable marketing site (room for Malay ~20-30% longer copy when Phase 7 ships)

No fixed-width buttons or tight headings.

## Motion

Motion personality:
subtle, intentional presence

Prefer:
`--duration-fast` / `--duration-base`, `--ease-out`, fade/opacity and light elevation

Avoid:
bouncy springs, long decorative loops, motion that delays reading or form completion

## Visual references

The site should feel closer to:

- precision B2B / enterprise IT services
- calm corporate engineering brand
- clear content hierarchy over dashboard chrome

Avoid feeling like:

- generic SaaS dashboard
- template marketplace UI
- AI-generated landing page
- purple-on-white, cream+terracotta+serif, or broadsheet newspaper layouts
